# Local reference and test material. None of it is part of EVA, and some of it
# is third-party code EVA explicitly does not redistribute — see
# THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Ignoring the whole tree rather than naming the
# copyleft ones individually, because the named list was the dangerous shape:
# it left the AMRI toolbox, the CWL-Webinar reference, and 1.4 GB of test
# recordings a `git add .` away from being committed.
#
# Dirty-room reviewers keep these locally; see docs/provenance/README.md.
resources/

# Dirty-room notes quote reference-toolbox internals and must not be committed.
docs/dirty-room/

# Documentation build output
site/

# Tier 7 pipeline-regression corpus, regenerated by run-all-tests.sh
.regression-corpus/
